<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Dome files shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Dome files shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tokyo Dome Corp, which operates a baseball stadium, said on Monday that it had applied to the Finance Ministry for a shelf registration to issue up to 50 billion yen worth of corporate bonds.</p>
<p>The registration will be effective for two years from August 1, it said.</p>
